<title>USA: Northwest Pipe buys California Steel assets.</title>
<headline>Northwest Pipe buys California Steel assets.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Pipe Co said it bought certain assets of California Steel Pressure Pipe Co, a maker of water transmission pipe located in Riverside, Calif.</p>
<p>This facility, which was recently closed by CSPPC, generated over $10 million in revenues in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said the acquisition opens a new market niche for steel water transmission pipe for Northwest Pipe and offers operational synergies.</p>
</text>
